{{!--
    A single post, in the layout chosen site-wide by the post_layout setting.

    An individual post can override that by picking a custom template — Wide,
    Immersive or Video — in the post settings sidebar. Those templates are
    thin: all three end up in partials/post-shell.hbs.
--}}
{{!< default}}

{{#post}}
    {{> "post-shell" layout=@custom.post_layout}}
{{/post}}
